# .gitignore file for Git #
# Author: Konstantine Garas
# E-mail: kgaras041@gmail.com
# Created: Mon 10 Mar 2025 @ 14:21:25 +0100
# Modified: Sat 08 Aug 2026 @ 18:25:30 +0200

### Linux ###
*~

# KDE directory preferences
.ipynb_checkpoints

# Python specific files
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/

# Python virtual environment
.venv/

# Linux trash folder which might appear on any partition or disk
.Trash-*

# .nfs files are created when an open file is removed but is still being accessed
.nfs*

# ignore all executable, database or log files
*.pdf
*.png
*.PNG
*.gif
*.csv
*.jpg
*.jpeg
data/
results/

# ...but the test golden fixtures ARE source, not generated output: they hold
# reference values captured from the pre-refactor solver and the regression
# suite fails to even import without them (see tests/test_pde_regression.py).
!tests/data/

# ignore language auxiliary files
## Python
*.pyc

# ignore the workspace files
*.code-workspace
*.vscode
*.claude
